{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/命运•无尽黑洞","pageid":6579,"revid":14937,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E5%B0%BD%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E5%B0%BD%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E5%B0%BD%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>命运•无尽黑洞</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.91.BD.E8.BF.90.E2.80.A2.E6.97.A0.E5.B0.BD.E9.BB.91.E6.B4.9E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"命运•无尽黑洞\"><b>命运•无尽黑洞</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 命运•无尽黑洞.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/orimzqalvod8rvig3ad38144wgqffiq.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E5%B0%BD%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/orimzqalvod8rvig3ad38144wgqffiq.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E6%97%A0%E5%B0%BD%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1c/orimzqalvod8rvig3ad38144wgqffiq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />命运•无尽黑洞\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对对面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"人造原初烙痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">人造原初烙痕</font></span></span>]点数，对目标地点范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有其他角色进行<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次攻击，每次造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">50%</font>范围伤害。处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"原初之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">原初之力</font></span></span>]期间，本技能额外拥有下列效果：第1次攻击前，对敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晶能引力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">晶能引力</font></span></span>]、<font color=\"#ed7950\">8</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">粉碎枷锁</font></span></span>](持续2回合)3次攻击分别使处于第<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>、<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>、<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格上的目标，向中心击退1格（不会打断准备技能）\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-4 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/46/8haq5yodeiuouyj76phrrm0ut26c0ub.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/46/8haq5yodeiuouyj76phrrm0ut26c0ub.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/46/8haq5yodeiuouyj76phrrm0ut26c0ub.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"223\" data-file-height=\"226\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B2%99%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF\" title=\"角色图